WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:44.980 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 4=

02:02.740 --> 02:03.540
Fang Muyang.

02:04.650 --> 02:06.000
Sometimes, I think

02:06.420 --> 02:07.530
you must've gone mad

02:07.530 --> 02:09.020
when you joined the production team.

02:10.090 --> 02:10.660
Why?

02:11.570 --> 02:12.460
If you're not mad,

02:12.460 --> 02:15.420
why would you let Ling Yi
take your place in university?

02:18.626 --> 02:20.071
I guess it makes sense, though.

02:20.200 --> 02:21.210
She's your girlfriend.

02:21.840 --> 02:23.250
It's only natural.

02:23.930 --> 02:24.890
But if it were me,

02:24.890 --> 02:25.860
I wouldn't do that.

02:28.200 --> 02:30.982
No worries. You can take my place.

02:33.450 --> 02:34.170
You think

02:34.340 --> 02:35.670
university slots

02:35.670 --> 02:37.090
are as common as corn kernels,

02:37.137 --> 02:38.760
and you can pick them off the ground?

02:40.180 --> 02:42.410
Still, why were you chosen, though?

02:43.137 --> 02:44.440
Is there some sort of trick?

02:48.450 --> 02:49.648
Are you okay?

02:50.300 --> 02:51.500
That hurts.

02:52.026 --> 02:53.537
By the way, what's your name?

02:53.810 --> 02:54.590
I'm Ling Yi.

02:54.970 --> 02:56.000
And you?

02:56.460 --> 02:57.130
I'm Ye Feng.

02:58.090 --> 02:59.360
Are you from this school?

02:59.530 --> 02:59.900
Yes.

03:00.140 --> 03:01.170
You remember Ling Yi?

03:02.426 --> 03:03.970
She visited me in the hospital.

03:06.530 --> 03:07.110
Ling Yi!

03:12.370 --> 03:13.780
Fei Ni, what a coincidence.

03:14.250 --> 03:16.070
You're here to watch
our basketball match?

03:16.850 --> 03:17.900
You know each other?

03:18.970 --> 03:19.900
Of course.

03:20.340 --> 03:22.970
Fei Ni works in
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory,

03:22.970 --> 03:24.870
and I'm in the factory's
basketball team.

03:31.860 --> 03:32.810
And this is?

03:36.880 --> 03:37.810
He's Fang Muyang,

03:37.893 --> 03:39.737
the hero who saved lives
in the thunderstorm.

03:41.120 --> 03:42.090
Hello, Fang Muyang.

03:42.370 --> 03:43.150
I'm Ye Feng.

03:43.160 --> 03:45.910
I'm the captain of Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory's basketball team.

03:47.590 --> 03:48.150
Hello.

03:48.570 --> 03:49.570
I'm Fang Muyang.

03:50.500 --> 03:51.490
You look tall

03:51.760 --> 03:52.500
and strong.

03:52.590 --> 03:54.137
You'd be a great addition to our team.

03:54.170 --> 03:54.900
Want to join?

03:54.900 --> 03:55.650
Ye Feng.

03:55.970 --> 03:57.200
Fei Ni is here for me.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.150
You can go now.

03:58.250 --> 04:00.115
Fei Ni will take me
to the infirmary.

04:01.210 --> 04:01.880
No worries.

04:02.230 --> 04:03.880
I'm free, so let's go together.

04:07.430 --> 04:09.690
Ye Feng, Ling Yi and I have
something private to discuss.

04:11.970 --> 04:12.460
Fair enough.

04:12.690 --> 04:13.190
Go ahead.

04:13.337 --> 04:15.315
The boys are waiting for me
at the court, anyway.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.140
I'm off.

04:16.470 --> 04:16.840
Bye.

04:17.271 --> 04:18.050
Consider my offer.

04:22.770 --> 04:24.360
Is your hand okay?

04:28.770 --> 04:29.440
I'm okay.

04:30.210 --> 04:32.010
So, let's talk.

04:41.130 --> 04:42.660
The way he draws

04:42.660 --> 04:44.090
still looks the same.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.693
He doesn't look like
he's lost his memories.

04:49.440 --> 04:51.540
He hasn't remembered the past,

04:52.190 --> 04:54.310
but he's learned a lot of life skills.

04:54.830 --> 04:56.030
In principle,

04:56.560 --> 04:58.640
other than forgetting the past,

04:58.740 --> 04:59.860
he's totally normal.

05:01.250 --> 05:02.570
Not exactly.

05:03.740 --> 05:05.240
The way he looks at me

05:05.830 --> 05:06.890
feels so distant.

05:07.100 --> 05:09.310
If you can visit him more often,

05:09.660 --> 05:10.980
perhaps he'd get better.

05:15.200 --> 05:15.890
Fei Ni.

05:16.630 --> 05:18.500
I know you look down on me.

05:19.071 --> 05:20.890
But you don't know
what I've been through.

05:20.890 --> 05:22.210
You have no right to lecture me.

05:22.890 --> 05:24.300
I'm not looking down on you.

05:25.310 --> 05:27.680
I think you have the right
to pursue your own happiness.

05:27.770 --> 05:29.210
But this isn't the time

05:29.210 --> 05:30.610
to leave Fang Muyang alone.

05:30.890 --> 05:32.570
What do you want me to do?

05:33.420 --> 05:34.450
I'm not a doctor.

05:34.450 --> 05:35.660
I can't cure him.

05:35.660 --> 05:37.070
But you're his girlfriend.

05:37.226 --> 05:38.510
You've been working together,

05:38.670 --> 05:40.330
and have been dating for so many years.

05:40.330 --> 05:41.310
You know him best.

05:41.690 --> 05:42.960
Dr. Liang also said

05:43.180 --> 05:44.860
that if you can help him
recall the past,

05:44.860 --> 05:46.620
it can help him recover his memory.

05:47.450 --> 05:48.490
That's why I'm here

05:48.670 --> 05:50.050
to ask you to help him.

05:50.050 --> 05:51.026
I'm not his girlfriend.

05:51.170 --> 05:52.110
I can't help him.

05:54.004 --> 05:55.840
Those words came from your own mouth.

06:04.382 --> 06:05.248
Fei Ni.

06:06.700 --> 06:07.920
You're noble and selfless.

06:08.660 --> 06:10.540
You can sacrifice yourself
to take care of him.

06:10.540 --> 06:11.515
That's your own choice.

06:11.515 --> 06:12.915
You can't demand me to do the same.

06:13.370 --> 06:14.240
Let me repeat this.

06:14.690 --> 06:15.770
I'm not his girlfriend.

06:16.340 --> 06:17.860
Don't talk to me again.

07:00.330 --> 07:01.540
What is this place?

07:02.570 --> 07:03.620
It's pretty.

07:06.010 --> 07:06.850
Pretty, right?

07:07.210 --> 07:07.860
Yeah.

07:08.440 --> 07:10.670
My brother and I
often came here to play as kids.

07:11.715 --> 07:13.620
I still come here when I feel down.

07:23.404 --> 07:24.370
What are you doing?

07:26.060 --> 07:26.940
Back in the hospital,

07:26.940 --> 07:28.560
the girl from the next room
cheers up

07:28.560 --> 07:29.480
when her dad does this.

07:31.210 --> 07:32.740
Don't you try that on me.

07:38.540 --> 07:39.210
Fang Muyang.

07:41.100 --> 07:42.750
If you can never remember

07:42.750 --> 07:43.770
the past,

07:44.210 --> 07:45.190
what should we do?

07:46.980 --> 07:47.810
The past?

07:49.060 --> 07:49.700
Is it important?

07:50.737 --> 07:52.915
I think there's nothing wrong
with the present.

07:53.100 --> 07:54.520
If I can't remember the past,

07:55.093 --> 07:56.450
it means it's not that important.

07:57.540 --> 07:58.700
If I forget my old friends,

07:59.760 --> 08:00.890
I'll just make new ones.

08:02.340 --> 08:03.600
Actually, I don't understand

08:04.540 --> 08:05.110
why everyone

08:05.110 --> 08:06.570
wants me to remember the past.

08:08.210 --> 08:09.690
Even if I can't remember,

08:10.330 --> 08:11.330
I'm still me.

08:12.770 --> 08:14.300
I won't become someone else.

08:17.980 --> 08:20.450
Don't you feel like
there's a burden on your chest?

08:21.180 --> 08:22.270
A little, at first.

08:22.770 --> 08:23.710
But not anymore.

08:24.860 --> 08:25.770
Because you're around.

08:32.060 --> 08:33.937
Do you remember where you used to live?

08:38.660 --> 08:39.680
Kangnan Road.

08:39.970 --> 08:41.020
When we were young,

08:41.020 --> 08:42.460
you brought us to your house.

08:48.810 --> 08:49.380
Come on.

08:57.900 --> 09:03.180
(44 Kangnan Road)

09:23.780 --> 09:24.730
Do you remember?

09:25.970 --> 09:26.970
You used to live here.

09:28.210 --> 09:29.550
Can you remember anything?

09:39.490 --> 09:42.520
This place probably looks different

09:42.782 --> 09:43.960
from when you were around.

09:44.570 --> 09:45.210
It's okay.

09:46.090 --> 09:47.020
Let's look around.

09:47.660 --> 09:48.180
Come on.

10:01.540 --> 10:02.600
Go, brother!

10:03.570 --> 10:04.880
Go, brother!

10:07.730 --> 10:09.760
Go, brother!

10:13.248 --> 10:14.600
(You're climbing trees again?)

10:15.180 --> 10:16.100
(Get down!)

10:18.940 --> 10:19.570
Yang!

10:23.210 --> 10:25.210
Yang, you're climbing trees again?

10:25.315 --> 10:27.070
You'll be squealing in pain
when you fall!

10:27.380 --> 10:28.290
Get down!

10:28.570 --> 10:30.690
(I bought ice cream today.)

10:31.370 --> 10:34.400
(- Happy birthday to you...)
(- Get down!)

10:34.880 --> 10:36.590
(I bought ice cream today.)

10:37.540 --> 10:38.090
Hao!

10:38.090 --> 10:39.380
Why are you climbing trees again?

10:39.420 --> 10:40.180
Get down!

10:43.610 --> 10:44.380
Why you...

10:44.380 --> 10:45.550
You naughty boy!

10:46.090 --> 10:47.090
If not for him,

10:47.090 --> 10:48.220
you'd have broken your leg!

10:48.810 --> 10:49.970
Thank you, comrade.

10:49.970 --> 10:50.560
Thank you.

10:50.850 --> 10:52.180
- You're welcome.
- Go home!

10:52.660 --> 10:52.980
Go!

10:53.240 --> 10:54.070
I'll tell your father

10:54.300 --> 10:55.200
what you've been up to.

10:55.380 --> 10:57.100
If you climb trees again,

10:57.271 --> 10:58.300
I'll beat your legs up!

11:01.630 --> 11:03.330
You may have lost your memories,

11:03.540 --> 11:05.490
but your heroic spirit is still there.

11:08.900 --> 11:09.440
Fei Ni.

11:09.530 --> 11:09.990
Yes?

11:10.140 --> 11:10.810
Let's go.

11:11.870 --> 11:13.430
Don't you want to go up?

11:13.780 --> 11:14.850
I want some ice cream.

11:21.210 --> 11:21.740
Thank you.

11:21.940 --> 11:22.690
You're welcome.

11:25.570 --> 11:26.970
You've been doing great today,

11:26.970 --> 11:28.626
so here's some ice cream as a reward.

11:33.620 --> 11:34.560
That's not ice cream.

11:35.960 --> 11:37.300
This is ice cream.

11:37.760 --> 11:38.730
It's not.

11:38.900 --> 11:39.650
What do you mean?

11:39.900 --> 11:40.810
It is ice cream.

12:06.160 --> 12:07.570
This is what ice cream looks like.

12:08.450 --> 12:09.180
Yours isn't.

12:13.070 --> 12:15.690
All you can think of is food, huh?

12:15.850 --> 12:17.640
I can't afford that expensive stuff.

12:17.671 --> 12:18.700
All I have is popsicles.

12:18.782 --> 12:19.770
Take it or leave it.

12:42.380 --> 12:43.330
Yummy.

12:59.826 --> 13:01.330
I'll buy you ice cream next time.

13:06.660 --> 13:07.900
Say.

13:09.300 --> 13:11.390
If you didn't tell anyone you're sick,

13:11.730 --> 13:12.830
who'd have thought you are?

13:26.820 --> 13:27.610
Fang Muyang.

13:29.060 --> 13:30.380
Can I ask for a favor?

13:36.660 --> 13:37.260
Ice cream.

13:48.340 --> 13:52.380
(Saving Lives,
Serving Workers and Peasants)

14:00.440 --> 14:01.090
Fang Muyang.

14:01.690 --> 14:03.010
I've written a short account

14:03.010 --> 14:05.060
of your parents and sister.

14:05.270 --> 14:06.690
It's not complete, but it's enough.

14:06.690 --> 14:09.690
I also made some stories about your time

14:10.420 --> 14:11.420
in the production team.

14:11.420 --> 14:13.000
Ms. Xu wouldn't know, anyway.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.170
I think we can get by.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.610
Most importantly, you need to remember

14:17.780 --> 14:18.940
this part.

14:19.730 --> 14:22.800
"When I was saving them,
my mind was blank.

14:22.800 --> 14:25.910
That's because to me,
saving lives is an instinct.

14:25.910 --> 14:27.400
It doesn't require preparation.

14:27.400 --> 14:28.580
If I must think of something,

14:28.580 --> 14:32.020
the only conviction I had

14:32.020 --> 14:33.720
was to stay determined,

14:33.720 --> 14:34.830
sacrifice myself

14:34.830 --> 14:37.530
to overcome hurdles and succeed."

14:41.940 --> 14:43.140
Are you listening?

14:44.648 --> 14:46.610
You want me to pretend
that I've recovered

14:47.210 --> 14:48.180
to deceive your superior?

14:49.020 --> 14:50.090
You...

14:53.060 --> 14:54.490
Don't say that.

14:55.380 --> 14:57.750
I know it's bad.

14:58.430 --> 15:00.610
I've been struggling inside for a while,

15:01.280 --> 15:02.570
and I've run out of options.

15:03.020 --> 15:04.020
After all,

15:04.020 --> 15:06.010
I've been taking care of you
for so many days,

15:06.730 --> 15:07.860
so help me, please.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.510
If you can help me,

15:13.910 --> 15:15.730
I'll buy you ice cream.

15:21.671 --> 15:22.810
What kind of face is that?

15:22.810 --> 15:23.660
Is that

15:24.030 --> 15:26.070
a no, or you can't memorize that?

15:28.810 --> 15:30.520
Yeah, you're still ill.

15:30.870 --> 15:31.900
It's pretty tough.

15:31.900 --> 15:33.050
I'll make it shorter.

15:36.280 --> 15:39.390
"When I was saving them,
my mind was blank.

15:40.090 --> 15:42.300
That's because to me,
saving lives is an instinct.

15:42.648 --> 15:44.120
It doesn't require preparation.

15:45.604 --> 15:46.850
If I must think of something,

15:48.030 --> 15:49.970
the only conviction I had

15:51.730 --> 15:53.030
was to stay determined,

15:53.490 --> 15:54.470
sacrifice myself

15:54.970 --> 15:55.850
to overcome hurdles

15:56.450 --> 15:57.380
and succeed."

16:00.080 --> 16:01.260
Fang Muyang.

16:01.600 --> 16:03.360
You're amazing!

16:07.490 --> 16:08.210
Fei Ni.

16:10.420 --> 16:11.330
Buy me an ice cream.

16:13.060 --> 16:13.850
It's a deal!

16:16.730 --> 16:19.330
This is great news!

16:19.380 --> 16:20.730
I heard from Fei Ni

16:20.900 --> 16:22.940
that you've recovered your full memory?

16:22.940 --> 16:24.260
This is great news!

16:24.260 --> 16:25.080
Hello, Ms. Xu.

16:25.400 --> 16:27.100
I've made a full recovery.

16:27.360 --> 16:28.560
You may rest assured.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.180
Now that you've recovered,

16:30.180 --> 16:31.940
you look much more energetic!

16:33.560 --> 16:34.020
Feng Lin.

16:34.400 --> 16:35.280
Pour some tea.

16:35.590 --> 16:36.560
Ms. Xu, have a seat.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.300
Sit down.

16:51.450 --> 16:52.400
Fang Muyang.

16:54.020 --> 16:56.570
Have you really remembered everything?

17:02.810 --> 17:03.260
Yes.

17:03.610 --> 17:05.200
He's remembered basically everything.

17:05.380 --> 17:07.530
But his brain was injured,

17:07.530 --> 17:10.100
so some parts of his memory
might be fuzzy.

17:10.100 --> 17:11.380
But the doctor said

17:11.380 --> 17:14.770
he can live and learn normally,

17:15.160 --> 17:16.820
so you could say he was fully recovered.

17:17.620 --> 17:18.210
Right?

17:18.210 --> 17:18.860
Fang Muyang?

17:19.380 --> 17:20.180
Comrade?

17:20.690 --> 17:21.290
Yes.

17:22.340 --> 17:22.970
Yes.

17:24.450 --> 17:26.710
Wonderful. How nice.

17:27.140 --> 17:28.340
Allow me to introduce

17:28.580 --> 17:31.200
Ms. Wang from our Publicity Division.

17:31.530 --> 17:32.820
I got her here

17:33.250 --> 17:35.690
to write an article about you.

17:35.830 --> 17:38.110
I'm going to make
everyone in the factory

17:38.340 --> 17:40.870
learn from your noble qualities.

17:41.180 --> 17:42.010
Hello, Ms. Wang.

17:42.010 --> 17:43.290
Hello, Fang Muyang.

17:43.290 --> 17:44.900
Why don't you start with

17:44.900 --> 17:46.070
what you thought

17:46.070 --> 17:47.250
when you were saving lives?

17:47.380 --> 17:47.700
Yeah.

17:47.810 --> 17:49.600
(Thank goodness I prepared for this.)

17:49.730 --> 17:50.490
Ms. Xu.

17:51.290 --> 17:53.110
When I was saving them,
my mind was blank.

17:53.120 --> 17:55.130
That's because to me,
saving lives is an instinct.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.419
It doesn't require preparation.

17:56.420 --> 17:57.650
If I must think of something...

17:58.310 --> 17:58.880
If...

18:01.500 --> 18:02.160
If I...

18:10.920 --> 18:11.660
If what?

18:12.640 --> 18:13.690
What were you thinking?

18:22.180 --> 18:22.820
Fei Ni.

18:24.730 --> 18:27.680
I thought he's fully recovered?

18:29.890 --> 18:30.400
He...

18:31.670 --> 18:32.620
Maybe...

18:33.910 --> 18:35.100
Maybe he's nervous.

18:37.260 --> 18:38.140
Fang Muyang.

18:38.860 --> 18:40.660
If you must think...

18:47.010 --> 18:48.090
If I must think,

18:49.100 --> 18:50.030
I want to say

18:50.770 --> 18:51.900
that the past few weeks

18:52.900 --> 18:54.340
were the happiest time I had

18:55.940 --> 18:57.140
since I could remember.

18:58.900 --> 19:00.490
Fei Ni often says that I'm a hero,

19:01.026 --> 19:02.537
and that she should learn from me.

19:03.140 --> 19:03.820
But she

19:05.310 --> 19:06.660
deserves my full admiration.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.280
To take care of me, a stranger,

19:10.290 --> 19:11.900
she sacrificed her own time,

19:12.490 --> 19:13.970
not asking for anything in return.

19:15.826 --> 19:17.860
She taught me everything,
from brushing my teeth.

19:18.480 --> 19:19.850
She was patient with me,

19:20.690 --> 19:21.630
and never gave up on me.

19:22.880 --> 19:23.730
I'm lucky

19:24.620 --> 19:26.350
to have met her just when

19:26.350 --> 19:26.920
I needed help.

19:28.140 --> 19:29.450
She helped me stand up again

19:30.210 --> 19:31.920
and face life.

19:33.010 --> 19:34.660
She is our true role model.

19:37.900 --> 19:39.090
Today, I'm able to stand here

19:39.090 --> 19:40.040
healthy and well

19:41.050 --> 19:41.940
because of her.

19:48.580 --> 19:49.530
Marvelous!

19:50.250 --> 19:51.400
Wonderful!

19:51.760 --> 19:52.580
A round of applause!

20:03.620 --> 20:04.530
Wonderful.

20:04.660 --> 20:05.470
Fei Ni.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.050
You did a great job!

20:07.230 --> 20:08.480
You have gloriously completed

20:08.480 --> 20:10.970
a gargantuan task assigned to you!

20:11.182 --> 20:13.530
Tomorrow, I'll put in a good word
with the factory leaders.

20:13.537 --> 20:14.870
An excellent worker like you

20:15.140 --> 20:16.010
ought to be

20:16.010 --> 20:16.940
a role model

20:16.940 --> 20:18.880
and a university student!

20:20.450 --> 20:21.580
Thank you, Ms. Xu!

20:21.580 --> 20:23.450
I won't disappoint you and the factory!

20:25.180 --> 20:26.250
How wonderful.

20:32.940 --> 20:33.690
Fang Muyang.

20:33.950 --> 20:35.680
Let's take a photo.

20:35.680 --> 20:36.300
- Yes.
- Sure.

20:36.300 --> 20:36.850
Come on.

20:54.004 --> 20:55.140
Why are you staring at me?

20:55.660 --> 20:58.180
Why didn't you follow my draft?

20:59.550 --> 21:01.190
You scared me when you said that.

21:01.530 --> 21:03.250
I already forgot about what you wrote.

21:04.026 --> 21:05.380
Besides, I didn't want to lie.

21:05.970 --> 21:07.420
You were still lying.

21:07.490 --> 21:08.450
What's with

21:08.900 --> 21:11.730
"the happiest time you had
since you could remember"?

21:11.730 --> 21:12.770
That's true.

21:13.250 --> 21:14.340
Impossible.

21:15.210 --> 21:16.840
As an amnesiac,

21:17.210 --> 21:18.400
whatever I could remember

21:18.650 --> 21:20.900
starts from the moment
I woke up in the hospital, right?

21:22.620 --> 21:23.810
Besides, I meant it

21:24.071 --> 21:26.093
when I said it was
the happiest time I had.

21:31.026 --> 21:32.050
You did a great job.

21:32.050 --> 21:33.210
I'll buy you an ice cream.

21:37.530 --> 21:38.140
Dig in.

21:40.970 --> 21:42.660
This is real ice cream.

21:42.970 --> 21:43.570
Dig in.

21:44.800 --> 21:46.440
But this isn't what I wanted to eat.

21:48.250 --> 21:49.340
That's enough.

21:49.620 --> 21:50.450
Don't draw.

21:50.580 --> 21:51.970
I know what you're thinking.

21:53.050 --> 21:54.640
I can't afford that.

21:54.770 --> 21:56.270
Only the fancy restaurants sell those.

21:56.670 --> 21:57.730
Try this.

21:58.450 --> 21:59.510
It's delicious.

22:09.730 --> 22:10.450
Yummy, right?

22:10.690 --> 22:11.920
I wasn't lying.

22:12.210 --> 22:13.450
You know,

22:13.450 --> 22:15.970
in the past, the only time
my parents would buy this for me

22:15.970 --> 22:17.648
was when I scored first place in exams.

22:19.515 --> 22:20.950
Do you often score first place?

22:22.000 --> 22:23.030
Not often.

22:23.450 --> 22:24.290
Every time.

22:25.471 --> 22:27.770
If university intakes are still
based on academic merit,

22:27.770 --> 22:29.050
I'd have secured a place.

22:29.050 --> 22:31.590
Unlike now,
where I have to resort to tricks.

22:36.420 --> 22:37.690
So, you took care of me

22:39.010 --> 22:40.340
to go to university?

22:54.450 --> 22:55.580
Of course not.

22:55.790 --> 22:56.770
Did I say that?

22:57.450 --> 22:58.780
Your brain is still injured.

22:58.780 --> 23:00.020
Maybe you heard wrongly.

23:01.820 --> 23:03.290
That's what you said.

23:03.730 --> 23:05.690
You had to resort to tricks
to go to university.

23:06.580 --> 23:07.700
What I said was,

23:07.700 --> 23:10.290
I took care of you
out of pure goodness from my heart.

23:11.920 --> 23:14.380
So, you had an ulterior motive.

23:16.450 --> 23:18.590
Isn't that normal?

23:18.900 --> 23:21.680
You needed someone to nurse you,
and I wanted to go to university.

23:21.920 --> 23:24.160
We're just satisfying
each others' needs.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.300
Would you say that in front of Ms. Xu?

23:28.380 --> 23:30.260
I wouldn't, and you can't, either.

23:30.490 --> 23:32.450
Now, we're on the same boat.

23:32.530 --> 23:33.530
Telling her

23:34.090 --> 23:35.140
won't do you any good.

23:36.960 --> 23:37.730
Not necessarily.

23:38.250 --> 23:39.170
I'm ill.

23:39.800 --> 23:41.110
If I'm in a bad mood,

23:41.110 --> 23:42.740
or I don't get to eat what I want,

23:43.220 --> 23:44.600
I might just blabber.

23:50.530 --> 23:51.210
Fine.

23:51.900 --> 23:54.010
I'll buy you that thing
in your sketchbook.

23:57.290 --> 23:57.820
What's wrong?

24:04.820 --> 24:06.530
I can't afford a piano!

24:06.530 --> 24:11.780
(Jiangcheng Vintage Store)

24:26.190 --> 24:26.940
Go on.

24:27.880 --> 24:28.730
I can't remember.

24:29.970 --> 24:32.110
You'll remember when you play.

24:32.630 --> 24:34.290
Your grandma had a piano, too.

24:34.290 --> 24:35.648
I'm sure you know how to play.

24:44.500 --> 24:45.270
I'll teach you.

24:50.340 --> 24:52.970
Your grandma donated her piano
to the school.

24:53.604 --> 24:55.450
That's how I learned to play the piano.

25:25.820 --> 25:30.540
♪In spring, I think of you♪

25:32.740 --> 25:37.540
♪In summer, I think of you♪

25:39.900 --> 25:42.740
♪The fallen leaves in autumn♪

25:42.820 --> 25:46.300
♪You belong to me♪

25:46.700 --> 25:50.460
♪When the world is covered in snow♪

25:50.540 --> 25:55.380
♪I still think of you♪

25:57.180 --> 26:02.260
♪There's a small place♪

26:03.820 --> 26:09.740
♪Where everyone has big dreams♪

26:11.020 --> 26:17.900
♪Every cute face♪

26:17.940 --> 26:24.340
♪Glows from the heart♪

26:24.580 --> 26:25.680
Can you remember anything?

26:27.740 --> 26:28.970
I can remember

26:29.970 --> 26:31.680
that I used to play the piano.

26:34.620 --> 26:35.340
What else?

26:39.260 --> 26:45.380
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

26:45.380 --> 26:45.920
Nothing.

26:48.660 --> 26:49.180
It's okay.

26:49.660 --> 26:51.140
It's a good start.

26:51.290 --> 26:52.290
I'm sure

26:52.420 --> 26:54.330
you'll remember everything soon.

26:54.390 --> 26:56.050
I'll make sure to get you
nutritious food.

26:56.050 --> 26:58.150
Who knows, you'll recover tomorrow.

27:00.950 --> 27:01.370
Yeah.

27:02.580 --> 27:03.180
Let's play.

27:19.010 --> 27:19.620
Ms. Xu.

27:20.915 --> 27:23.340
Here's your speech draft
for the meeting two days later.

27:23.530 --> 27:24.640
Is there anything

27:24.640 --> 27:25.630
you want me to change?

27:29.450 --> 27:32.210
You're getting better at writing.

27:32.426 --> 27:35.026
The last time I attended
a campaign meeting in the city,

27:35.182 --> 27:36.400
my speech was highly praised

27:36.400 --> 27:37.890
by the city-level leaders.

27:40.140 --> 27:41.390
You're the one

27:41.710 --> 27:44.480
in this factory
who understands me the most.

27:45.040 --> 27:46.180
Given your ability,

27:46.580 --> 27:47.900
writing speeches for me

27:48.182 --> 27:49.310
is a waste of your talent.

27:49.970 --> 27:51.780
No, Ms. Xu.

27:52.770 --> 27:54.270
You took me under your wing.

27:54.770 --> 27:55.970
I got to enter the university

27:56.340 --> 27:57.500
because you recommended me.

27:58.090 --> 27:59.330
I'm just doing my part.

27:59.580 --> 28:00.380
Besides,

28:00.770 --> 28:02.770
nothing else helps me improve faster

28:02.770 --> 28:03.900
than learning from you.

28:06.290 --> 28:07.010
Ms. Xu.

28:07.580 --> 28:09.450
The Publicity Board has been updated.

28:10.510 --> 28:11.210
Got it.

28:13.380 --> 28:14.080
Let's see it.

28:22.380 --> 28:23.100
Feng.

28:24.020 --> 28:26.260
What do you think of this edition?

28:30.493 --> 28:31.280
It looks energetic.

28:31.580 --> 28:32.580
It's also neat

28:32.582 --> 28:33.730
and beautifully written.

28:33.760 --> 28:35.239
The new university graduates recruited

28:35.240 --> 28:37.110
by Publicity Division
this time are impressive.

28:41.620 --> 28:42.140
Ms. Xu.

28:43.970 --> 28:46.560
Are you really going to recommend
Fei Ni for the university slot?

28:48.970 --> 28:49.520
What's wrong?

28:50.420 --> 28:51.790
You think she's not good enough?

28:52.640 --> 28:53.210
No.

28:54.740 --> 28:55.490
I was just thinking

28:55.782 --> 28:57.290
that the factory has already chosen

28:57.290 --> 28:58.340
our candidates this year.

28:58.340 --> 28:59.871
Maybe she can wait till next year.

28:59.915 --> 29:00.537
Perfect timing.

29:00.770 --> 29:01.810
I was about to ask

29:02.250 --> 29:03.820
for your opinion on this matter.

29:04.770 --> 29:05.910
I was planning

29:06.420 --> 29:09.520
to let Wang Defa
join next year's intake.

29:10.080 --> 29:13.650
After all, he was chosen
without proper consideration,

29:13.820 --> 29:15.170
so we ought to observe him further.

29:15.380 --> 29:16.800
Besides, Fei Ni

29:17.180 --> 29:19.070
has made a significant contribution.

29:19.248 --> 29:21.804
No one would question
if we bend the rules for her this time.

29:22.380 --> 29:23.210
But, Ms. Xu.

29:23.210 --> 29:24.660
- This is...
- Feng.

29:25.230 --> 29:27.290
Are you in a relationship

29:28.180 --> 29:30.050
with Wang Defa?

29:33.860 --> 29:35.250
It's okay to date,

29:36.000 --> 29:38.204
but you're part of the factory's
core management team.

29:38.560 --> 29:40.620
If you insist on
referring him to university,

29:41.770 --> 29:44.180
it might cause some misunderstanding.

29:45.140 --> 29:46.480
That's why I'm doing this

29:46.970 --> 29:48.790
for your own good.

29:49.050 --> 29:50.940
He's going to university,

29:51.100 --> 29:52.290
just later.

29:52.940 --> 29:54.370
You don't need to rush.

29:55.450 --> 29:56.250
I understand.

29:57.660 --> 29:58.720
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

29:59.660 --> 30:01.280
Another reminder.

30:01.630 --> 30:03.240
You're not married yet.

30:03.650 --> 30:05.050
Be mindful of what you do.

30:06.080 --> 30:08.170
If word of this gets out,

30:08.420 --> 30:09.770
people might assume

30:10.250 --> 30:11.750
improper things about the factory.

30:13.730 --> 30:14.650
Don't worry, Ms. Xu.

30:30.340 --> 30:39.860
(Hongxing Supply
and Marketing Cooperative)

31:00.250 --> 31:01.600
Here, take this.

31:02.340 --> 31:03.140
Lin Mei.

31:06.340 --> 31:07.660
You look like you have good news.

31:10.250 --> 31:11.190
How should I put it?

31:11.970 --> 31:14.290
The person standing before you

31:14.290 --> 31:16.590
is not the usual Fei Ni,

31:17.620 --> 31:21.750
but a future student of
the Worker-Peasant-Soldier University.

31:22.210 --> 31:23.140
Really?

31:24.310 --> 31:24.820
Keep it down.

31:25.530 --> 31:26.220
Keep it down.

31:26.580 --> 31:27.260
Ms. Chen.

31:27.450 --> 31:29.210
Mind the counter for me.
I'll be right back.

31:29.210 --> 31:30.490
Let's talk outside.

31:31.100 --> 31:32.070
Come on.

31:32.420 --> 31:33.180
What's the story?

31:33.180 --> 31:34.610
Don't put your hands behind.

31:35.580 --> 31:36.050
Come on.

31:38.770 --> 31:39.210
Here.

31:41.660 --> 31:43.782
Your factory is letting you
go to university?

31:44.180 --> 31:45.360
They haven't announced it yet,

31:45.360 --> 31:46.580
but Ms. Xu said

31:46.580 --> 31:47.770
my slot is guaranteed.

31:47.970 --> 31:49.970
I'm sure they'll announce it

31:49.970 --> 31:51.026
when my brother returns.

31:51.340 --> 31:51.820
Phooey.

31:51.820 --> 31:52.470
Touch wood.

31:54.730 --> 31:55.250
Why?

31:55.626 --> 31:56.820
When your brother returns,

31:57.290 --> 31:58.860
it'd probably be years later.

32:00.900 --> 32:01.840
What's wrong?

32:02.026 --> 32:04.137
Hasn't he submitted
his application to return?

32:05.640 --> 32:06.240
Of course not.

32:07.450 --> 32:09.450
Back in autumn,
he said after the autumn harvest.

32:09.450 --> 32:11.620
In winter, he said
that the mountain roads are closed.

32:11.620 --> 32:13.110
Now that it's spring,

32:13.204 --> 32:14.671
he said he's planting new crops.

32:15.800 --> 32:17.210
I don't get it.

32:17.510 --> 32:18.620
Is he the only worker

32:19.100 --> 32:20.470
in Great Northern Wilderness?

32:20.970 --> 32:23.180
It's not like everyone
in Great Northern Wilderness

32:23.180 --> 32:24.310
would starve without him.

32:25.620 --> 32:26.380
I think

32:26.380 --> 32:27.826
he's not even planning to come back.

32:28.050 --> 32:29.420
Impossible.

32:29.420 --> 32:31.040
Who wouldn't want to come home?

32:31.340 --> 32:32.100
I'll ask him

32:32.340 --> 32:33.420
the next time I call him.

32:36.140 --> 32:37.290
Forget it, stay out of this.

32:37.730 --> 32:39.110
Just focus on your plans.

32:40.180 --> 32:41.900
This is his only chance to return.

32:41.970 --> 32:43.180
I'll kidnap him if I have to.

32:43.340 --> 32:44.730
You don't need my help?

32:44.730 --> 32:45.320
No.

32:46.010 --> 32:47.010
I know how to handle

32:47.290 --> 32:48.380
your brother.

32:48.750 --> 32:49.260
Fine.

32:52.900 --> 32:54.770
Come on, I need to buy some meat.

32:55.690 --> 32:56.730
Someone's splurging today.

32:56.900 --> 32:58.570
I'm cooking for Fang Muyang.

32:59.537 --> 33:00.730
I think there's meat in stock.

33:00.730 --> 33:01.180
Come on.

33:07.010 --> 33:07.730
Lin Mei.

33:07.730 --> 33:08.450
Ms. Feng.

33:08.450 --> 33:09.840
Meat available
at the cooperative tomorrow?

33:09.848 --> 33:10.293
Yes.

33:10.380 --> 33:11.530
Come early tomorrow.

33:11.530 --> 33:12.210
Okay.

33:16.210 --> 33:18.300
(Mrs. Lin)
Your favorite egg soup.

33:18.710 --> 33:19.050
Here.

33:19.050 --> 33:19.760
Open your mouth.

33:20.340 --> 33:21.080
Yummy?

33:21.080 --> 33:22.740
(Lin Jianshe)

33:22.860 --> 33:23.430
Mom.

33:23.430 --> 33:24.010
I'm back.

33:24.420 --> 33:25.180
You're back.

33:25.180 --> 33:26.010
Here, Jianshe.

33:26.010 --> 33:27.360
Finish this in the kitchen.

33:27.580 --> 33:28.420
Be careful.

33:28.420 --> 33:29.690
Don't spill it.

33:31.420 --> 33:32.730
You don't have to make him hide.

33:32.860 --> 33:33.530
I wouldn't

33:33.530 --> 33:35.200
steal food from a kid.

33:35.782 --> 33:37.071
Here, this month's meat coupons.

33:38.250 --> 33:39.050
Meat coupons?

33:39.050 --> 33:40.900
How many days have you been keeping it?

33:40.900 --> 33:41.871
Seriously.

33:51.010 --> 33:51.940
Go cook dinner.

33:51.940 --> 33:53.915
Your dad and brother
are getting off work soon.

33:54.210 --> 33:55.970
Aihong is working night shift,
isn't she?

33:55.970 --> 33:57.140
Why isn't she cooking?

33:57.140 --> 33:58.340
She's working night shift,

33:58.340 --> 33:59.770
so she needs to rest during the day,

33:59.770 --> 34:01.300
or else she won't have energy to work.

34:01.620 --> 34:03.130
I've been standing all day too.

34:03.130 --> 34:04.050
I'm tired as well.

34:05.250 --> 34:06.240
Why are you complaining?

34:06.240 --> 34:08.010
What's wrong with doing some chores?

34:08.010 --> 34:08.900
Think about it.

34:09.120 --> 34:10.010
Your sister-in-law

34:10.010 --> 34:12.050
let you take over her job
in the cooperative.

34:12.060 --> 34:14.071
That's why she's working
in the mechanical factory,

34:14.071 --> 34:15.300
working irregular shifts.

34:15.300 --> 34:16.490
How exhausting.

34:16.970 --> 34:18.730
She let me take over her job?

34:18.730 --> 34:20.604
It was your job before you retired,
so I took over.

34:20.626 --> 34:21.620
That's perfectly normal.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.280
Your daughter is worth less

34:23.520 --> 34:24.700
than your daughter-in-law now?

34:25.460 --> 34:27.900
Once you get married,
you won't be part of the family anymore.

34:27.900 --> 34:30.270
Your dad and I will have to rely on
Aihong and your brother

34:30.270 --> 34:31.040
to take care of us.

34:31.650 --> 34:33.340
Be grateful.

34:33.340 --> 34:35.380
So many educated youths
are jobless once they return.

34:35.380 --> 34:37.130
They can't even afford to buy a bed.

34:37.130 --> 34:38.740
Why do you keep sulking

34:38.740 --> 34:40.450
when I ask you to do some chores?

34:43.010 --> 34:43.610
Mom.

34:43.700 --> 34:45.340
Stop lecturing Lin Mei.

34:45.570 --> 34:46.900
Cooking dinner, is it?

34:46.970 --> 34:47.740
I'll do it.

34:48.940 --> 34:49.650
Why you...

35:08.970 --> 35:10.248
I'll do it.

35:11.940 --> 35:13.100
If I make you work,

35:13.100 --> 35:14.340
I'd be a sinner.

35:14.340 --> 35:15.900
Be nice to your sister-in-law!

35:15.970 --> 35:17.960
(Fang Aihong)
Is it so difficult to cook dinner?

35:18.004 --> 35:19.070
Ungrateful!

35:19.790 --> 35:21.220
Mom, don't be mad.

35:23.300 --> 35:24.170
What are you making?

35:25.130 --> 35:26.660
Making a scarf for my grandson.

35:26.660 --> 35:27.490
Nice color, isn't it?

35:27.490 --> 35:28.570
Yes, it looks pretty.

35:30.420 --> 35:30.860
Dinner?

35:31.570 --> 35:32.250
Huh?

35:35.130 --> 35:36.100
No dinner.

35:45.260 --> 35:45.970
Comrade.

35:45.970 --> 35:47.440
I'd like to make a long-distance call.

36:05.430 --> 36:05.860
Hello?

36:06.200 --> 36:06.740
Lin Mei?

36:08.360 --> 36:10.248
Have you prepared
your return application?

36:12.220 --> 36:12.810
Lin Mei.

36:13.990 --> 36:14.970
Don't be angry.

36:15.420 --> 36:16.090
Listen to me.

36:18.480 --> 36:20.260
I really can't go back now.

36:23.830 --> 36:25.160
There's only one slot,

36:25.570 --> 36:27.230
and you finally stand a chance.

36:27.420 --> 36:29.120
If you don't submit it, it's gone.

36:29.700 --> 36:30.450
Fei Ting.

36:31.450 --> 36:32.320
I'm telling you.

36:34.071 --> 36:37.160
I don't want to stay with
my family any longer, even for a day.

36:40.680 --> 36:41.870
Come back quickly.

36:44.300 --> 36:45.230
Otherwise, I...

36:46.430 --> 36:47.120
Or else...

36:47.700 --> 36:48.820
Even if I go back,

36:48.820 --> 36:50.190
we have no place to stay.

36:52.970 --> 36:53.450
Lin Mei.

36:53.970 --> 36:55.420
You know my family.

36:55.420 --> 36:56.630
There are only two rooms.

36:56.900 --> 36:58.010
If we get married,

36:58.780 --> 37:00.780
we'd have to kick Ni out.

37:03.310 --> 37:03.700
You...

37:05.180 --> 37:06.780
Is this why you don't want to come back?

37:10.900 --> 37:12.760
Why would I kick Fei Ni out?

37:14.870 --> 37:15.440
But...

37:17.090 --> 37:18.470
But if you keep putting it off...

37:19.450 --> 37:19.820
I...

37:21.490 --> 37:22.780
What should I do?

37:24.190 --> 37:26.480
My parents are already
arranging blind dates for me.

37:27.940 --> 37:28.650
Fei Ting.

37:30.010 --> 37:31.450
You need to be considerate of me.

37:39.860 --> 37:41.010
Lin Mei, I...

37:43.290 --> 37:44.030
I'm sorry.

37:45.700 --> 37:47.280
If you can find someone better,

37:48.700 --> 37:49.080
I...

37:51.450 --> 37:52.490
I wish you well.

38:22.900 --> 38:26.740
(Application to Return)

38:53.900 --> 38:57.900
(Inpatient Department)

39:13.920 --> 39:14.440
Wait.

39:14.626 --> 39:16.250
How do you know he hasn't recovered yet?

39:16.560 --> 39:17.840
He didn't recognize me

39:17.915 --> 39:19.070
when he saw me in the office.

39:20.130 --> 39:21.220
Something's off.

39:25.520 --> 39:26.490
Go, test him.

39:26.640 --> 39:28.120
What if he recognizes me?

39:28.120 --> 39:28.820
Come on.

39:29.750 --> 39:31.170
If he's regained his memories,

39:31.440 --> 39:33.200
he'd remember you anyway.

39:33.820 --> 39:35.370
But if he doesn't recognize you,

39:35.780 --> 39:37.650
it means he hasn't
recovered his memories.

39:37.990 --> 39:39.820
That means Fei Ni deceived Ms. Xu.

39:40.900 --> 39:43.220
Then, you'd still
get to go to university.

39:45.490 --> 39:46.860
Anyway, it's your choice.

39:46.860 --> 39:47.570
Whatever.

39:49.050 --> 39:49.740
I'll go.

40:03.380 --> 40:04.150
My leg.

40:05.420 --> 40:06.300
My leg!

40:06.530 --> 40:08.470
My leg has been crushed!

40:08.470 --> 40:09.530
- Comrade.
- My leg!

40:09.530 --> 40:10.610
- Help!
- Are you okay?

40:10.610 --> 40:13.050
- My leg has been crushed!
- Let me help you get up.

40:14.040 --> 40:14.480
Here.

40:16.300 --> 40:17.010
Are you okay?

40:17.010 --> 40:18.220
I'm fine.

40:19.060 --> 40:19.820
Thank you, Comrade.

40:20.110 --> 40:21.260
My leg

40:21.520 --> 40:22.340
was injured.

40:22.680 --> 40:23.430
It was

40:23.890 --> 40:24.590
crushed by

40:25.170 --> 40:26.190
a tree.

40:27.400 --> 40:27.970
A tree?

40:27.970 --> 40:28.630
Yes.

40:29.737 --> 40:31.120
Want me to take you to a doctor?

40:31.720 --> 40:33.010
No need.

40:33.600 --> 40:35.010
It's just a trivial issue.

40:35.280 --> 40:36.230
Be careful, then.

40:36.750 --> 40:38.400
Sure, thank you.

40:38.700 --> 40:39.290
Thank you.

40:39.290 --> 40:39.820
No worries.

40:54.970 --> 40:56.010
He didn't recognize me.

40:56.130 --> 40:58.060
He looked at me as if I were a stranger.

40:59.280 --> 41:00.200
Fei Ni.

41:00.690 --> 41:02.660
Let's see how you'll keep
this facade up.

41:02.700 --> 41:05.430
(Strict, Serious)

41:05.430 --> 41:06.130
What?

41:07.110 --> 41:09.440
Fang Muyang hasn't fully recovered?

41:11.280 --> 41:13.050
I went to visit Fang Muyang today

41:13.340 --> 41:14.640
while representing the factory

41:14.670 --> 41:15.610
to thank the hospital.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.680
But Dr. Liang told me

41:17.980 --> 41:20.050
that he's not aware
of Fang Muyang's recovery.

41:20.337 --> 41:21.520
So, I investigated further.

41:21.670 --> 41:23.740
I talked to Fang Muyang's nurse

41:23.740 --> 41:25.280
and other patients who talked to him.

41:25.900 --> 41:27.520
Everyone said

41:27.910 --> 41:30.340
that Fang Muyang hasn't recovered yet.

41:33.570 --> 41:34.440
Feng.

41:36.060 --> 41:36.970
Mind you,

41:37.480 --> 41:40.480
you're accusing the hero of lying.

41:41.520 --> 41:42.320
Be careful.

41:46.670 --> 41:47.480
Do you have evidence?

41:47.780 --> 41:48.600
Ms. Xu.

41:48.740 --> 41:49.950
You know me best.

41:50.137 --> 41:51.220
If I didn't have evidence,

41:51.248 --> 41:52.550
I wouldn't make such accusations.

41:54.170 --> 41:54.900
Look, Ms. Xu.

41:55.115 --> 41:56.910
This is the hospital's diagnosis report.

41:58.000 --> 41:58.550
Of course,

41:59.040 --> 42:01.004
(Diagnosis Report)
I trust Fang Muyang is a decent man.

42:01.048 --> 42:01.820
(Diagnosis: Amnesia caused by
external trauma, blood clot remains)

42:01.820 --> 42:02.700
I'm just worried

42:03.800 --> 42:05.137
that he's been manipulated.

42:28.080 --> 42:28.720
Ms. Tu.

42:29.440 --> 42:32.320
Do you know why Ms. Xu wants to see me?

42:32.720 --> 42:33.550
I don't know.

42:33.720 --> 42:34.560
Wait here.

42:49.093 --> 42:49.950
Hello, Ms. Xu.

42:50.070 --> 42:50.410
Hello.

42:52.080 --> 42:53.200
Hello, Ms. Xu.

43:02.160 --> 43:03.940
Ms. Xu, you wanted to see me?

43:03.940 --> 43:04.530
Fei Ni.

43:05.260 --> 43:07.440
I hope you can tell me the truth.

43:08.060 --> 43:09.230
Has Fang Muyang

43:10.100 --> 43:12.260
fully recovered?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
